      "notes": [
        "User command: torchrun --standalone --nproc_per_node=2 gpt2_ddp_training.py --output /tmp/original-ddp --profile. That command runs the project's own readiness harness: one correctness pass against a serial single-GPU reference that replays the exact global batch, warmup 2, 5 clean timed repeats, 3 separately profiled diagnostic iterations, a further comm-hook bucket inventory pass, and result.json writing. adapter.run() repeats only one accumulated training step; statistical warmup/repeats, reference construction, correctness checks, profiling and report writing are measurement infrastructure mapped to the dedicated fields.",
        "Source communication metric (workloads.json gpt2_ddp_training.communication_metric_caveat; README.md:48): sum of device NCCL kernel durations per rank in a separately profiled invocation, then maximum across ranks, then median of the 3 profiled samples; it includes device waiting and is not wire time, exposed communication or a critical-path bound. Mapped to installed collector field torch_communication.communication_kernel_sum_ms with rank_aggregation=max.",
